<SiteLayout path="/support" title="Client IT Support | Tech Judge" description="Already a Tech Judge client? Contact our support team by phone or email. Include your location, affected system and what you’re seeing.">
 <PageHeader eyebrow="Client support" title="Need a hand?" intro="If we already look after your technology, contact our support team directly. You don’t need to fill out a sales enquiry."/>
 <section class="section light"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Talk to your team.</h2><div class="inline-actions"><a class="button" href="tel:+18182132050">Call (818) 213-2050</a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:support@techjudge.com">support@techjudge.com</a></div><p class="lead">Usual support hours are 8am to 5pm Pacific. Any additional coverage follows your service agreement.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>Help us get to the issue.</h2><ul><li>Your name, company and location</li><li>Which device or system is affected</li><li>What you’re seeing and when it started</li><li>Whether one person or the wider team is affected</li><li>A number where we can reach you</li></ul><p>Don’t send passwords or sensitive client information by email. If your main system is down, call and explain the impact on your team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact-us">Not a client yet? Start here.</a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
